              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "domesticator"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Beautiful recipe. Delicious, as well as super easy to make. I added some orange zest and juice because I had no vanilla on hand and sprinkled icing sugar on top for decoration. I'm looking forward to making it exactly to recipe next time for pure chocolatey goodness. Thanks!"
          },
